<title>POLAND: Rafako to resume trade Wed after flood.</title>
<headline>Rafako to resume trade Wed after flood.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish industrial boilermaker Rafako SA, suspended from Warsaw bourse trade since July 11 due to flooding, will resume trade on Wednesday August 6 without the daily 10-percent price-fluctuation limit, the bourse said.</p>
<p>The bourse's statement on Monday came the same day as the firm's 18.9-million-zloty preliminary flood damage estimate, which said this year's sales forecast of 370 million zlotys had not been changed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
